-- SUPABASE AUTH MIGRATION: PSEUDO-AUTH TO TRUE OAUTH + RLS LOCKDOWN
-- PHASE 1: SCHEMA ADJUSTMENTS FOR OAUTH & PREMIUM

-- Profiles adjustment: phone is no longer required for Google OAuth
